      "message": "Could you turn this into `MemoryTracker::shared_pool: Option\u003cLockedHeap\u003c32\u003e\u003e`?\n\nLocking for `init_shared_pool(\u0026mut self, range: Range\u003cusize\u003e)` would then come naturally from accessing `MEMORY` (see aosp/2548232) and `alloc_shared` and `dealloc_shared` could simply `let Some(pool) \u003d memory.shared_pool` to decide if they allocate from that or the `global_allocator`, abstracting away hypervisor logic.",
